**Passed Test Case: `test_user_input_birthdate`**

**Pseudocode:**
```plaintext
CLASS BirthdateManager:
    FUNCTION __init__(file_path: str):
        SET self.file_path = file_path
        SET self.birthdates = []

    FUNCTION validate_birthdate(birthdate: str) -> bool:
